      "hints": [
        "Let $t=\\tan\\theta$ and use $\\cot2\\theta=(1-t^2)/(2t)$.",
        "Substitute into the equation, clear the denominator, and collect a quadratic in $t$.",
        "Solve the quadratic for both possible tangent values.",
        "For each value, find every angle in $0^\\circ<\\theta<180^\\circ$."
