        "Use the $\\tan2A$ formula to obtain an equation in $\\tan\\theta$ only",
        "Obtain a correct horizontal equation",
        "Rearrange equation as a quadratic in $\\tan\\theta$, e.g. $3\\tan^2\\theta+2\\tan\\theta-1=0$",
        "Solve for $\\theta$ (usual requirements for solution of quadratic)",
        "Obtain answer, e.g. $18.4^\\circ$",
        "Obtain second answer, e.g. $135^\\circ$, and no others in the given interval",
        "$3\\tan^2\\theta+2\\tan\\theta-1=0$; $\\theta=18.4^\\circ$ or $135^\\circ$."
